                 Same hazard the net.kyori pins below already work around, but the BOM did not
                 previously reach these.
                 All three resolve to `provided` scope, none is imported by our source, and
                 none is shaded into the JAR. See IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md §C2. -->
